'''Seasonal Gacha Events''' are special [[:Category:Gacha Event|Gacha Events]] that appear for 2-3 weeks annually to celebrate certain holidays and seasons. Each contains a set of [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]] and occasionally [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cats]] themed after the event, as well as three [[:Category:Brainwashed Cats|Brainwashed Cats]] that are randomly chosen for every new appearance of the event.

